%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b2bec28576622e5469ff125d61c4e3a5, type: 3}
  m_Name: HR_1_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: Ayoooo! It's me again :)\nDid you miss me?
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: Now, this is where I worked, before my stupid boss fired me. \nYou are
      now in the HR offices, where my ex-Boss usually works.
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad771f752afefa244b5c465f7173d61b, type: 3}
    text: He has to pay for firing me!!! Do you want to know what he did to me???
    tags: 
  - speakerName: PIP
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: 'Nope. Not interested : /'
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: ... Anyway, let's focus! We need to <u>find his home address</u>.
    tags: 03000000
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: See the office right there? There's his workstation.
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: Maybe he saved his address inside his computer, we need to check.
    tags: 03000000
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5ff570c2964bbe748bf7be2ffcc8bd95, type: 3}
    text: Also, while you're here, maybe you can <u><i><b>WRITE</b></i> a complaint
      on him</u>. It could be fun eheh!
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ab0fecf046fa7549b5e86ae6d70be77, type: 3}
    text: I think there's a program to do so in one of the other computers around
      here. You need to find it!
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: Don't worry, I'll write every step you need in the list :)
    tags: 02000000
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: But be careful! Although it's evening, there are some people inside the
      offices. If they see you, it's <color=red>GAME OVER</color>.
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: '<u>Just some tips</u>: you can dodge them, but if you are too close they
      may hear you, then became suspicious and start patrolling around.\nIf their
      suspicion is too high, it''s <color=red>GAME OVER</color> anyway.'
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ab0fecf046fa7549b5e86ae6d70be77, type: 3}
    text: You can also stun your "enemies" by clicking the AC when they are below
      it, or throw something in their face (without being notice, of course)
    tags: 
  - speakerName: PIP
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: 'Nobody ever told you you''re excessively chatty? '
    tags: 
